{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e06-scene-10",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "头顶上的一把剑  (A Sword Hanging Over Unit One)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the hospital, Xingzi breaks the news to newly recovered producer Kaiwen that Chun Yuqiao let Bu Xiaogu go, right before a surprise phone call from Xin Huimei's side sends Kaiwen joking about checking straight back in. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大放布小谷走了，你病刚好，不能生气。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他是想让我再进医院呢，还是他自己想进医院呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我总觉得有什么不对。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大本来是留下布小谷的，现在变成这个样子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你说中间发生了什么？问老大也不说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "能说出来的都是小事，他不说肯定是大事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "头顶上一直有一把剑，就是不落下来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那两个人一直都没动静，盯紧他们，还有那个边边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我住一礼拜医院，回来之后我还盯他们俩。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "谁要约老大？辛惠美！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我回医院！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不好意思，你继续说。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大放布小谷走了，你病刚好，不能生气。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The boss let Bu Xiaogu go; you have only just recovered, so you must not get angry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他是想让我再进医院呢，还是他自己想进医院呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Does he want to put me back in hospital, or does he want to end up in hospital himself?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我总觉得有什么不对。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I cannot shake the feeling that something is off.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大本来是留下布小谷的，现在变成这个样子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The boss originally meant to keep Bu Xiaogu, and now things have turned out like this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你说中间发生了什么？问老大也不说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you think happened in between? Even when I ask the boss, he says nothing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "能说出来的都是小事，他不说肯定是大事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Anything he can talk about is minor; if he stays silent, it is definitely serious.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "头顶上一直有一把剑，就是不落下来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There has been a sword hanging overhead all along, refusing to fall.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "那两个人一直都没动静，盯紧他们，还有那个边边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Those two have been quiet all this time; keep a close eye on them, and on that Bianbian too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我住一礼拜医院，回来之后我还盯他们俩。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I spent a week in hospital, and once I am back I am watching the pair of them.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "谁要约老大？辛惠美！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who wants to meet the boss? Xin Huimei!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我回医院！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am going back into the hospital!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不好意思，你继续说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excuse me, please go on.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大放布小谷走了，你病刚好，不能生气。",
      "gap": 0.5
